  81:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** * Summary:
  82:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  This function first disconnects the last connection made with FastSelect or
  83:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  Select, then connects the given channel. The FastSelect function is similar
  84:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  to the Select function, except it is faster since it only disconnects the
  85:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  last channel selected rather than all channels.
